  "name": "T-Wave Source Location Retrieval (PMEL Vents)",
  "description": "Provides earthquake location data using T-Wave sources locations derived from the U.S. Navy's Sound Surveillance System (SOSUS) for the N.E. Pacific Ocean especially Juan de Fuca Ridge area starting Year 1991 Julian Day 240 21:11:33.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: To monitor the global ocean through underwater acoustics.",
